stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> none
    state none
    state running
    none --> running : round.start [g1], round.start [g2]
    note right of running
        g1: NOT pr.fork AND placer.may_push
    end note
    note right of running
        g2: pr.same_repo_change_branch AND (pr.refs OR pr.closes) AND standing_grant(...) is not None AND grant_placer.may_push
    end note
